      "otherRequirements": {"status":"verified","items":["Apply directly to one Cornell college or school; applications are reviewed by that college","Cornell supplement with college-specific essay(s) required; two teacher recommendations required","Personal interviews not required or available (except Architecture)","Duffield Engineering: one teacher recommendation must be from a math, science or computer science teacher; two 200-word and four 100-word engineering essays"],"sources":[{"url":"https://admissions.cornell.edu/how-to-apply/first-year-applicants","label":"Cornell: First-Year Applicants"},{"url":"https://faq.enrollment.cornell.edu/kb/article/296-as-an-international-student-how-will-my-application-be-read/","label":"Cornell Admissions FAQ: How will my application be read?"},{"url":"https://admissions.cornell.edu/how-to-apply/first-year-applicants","label":"Cornell: First-Year Applicants"},{"url":"https://faq.enrollment.cornell.edu/kb/article/179-does-cornell-require-personal-interviews/","label":"Cornell Admissions FAQ: Does Cornell require personal interviews?"},{"url":"https://admissions.cornell.edu/first-year-duffield-engineering-applicants","label":"Cornell: First-Year Duffield Engineering Applicants"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":["At Cornell, you'll apply directly to one of our colleges or schools; be sure to explore your options to choose your best fit. Once you've made your decision, review unique application requirements for that college or school by clicking the appropriate link below.","All applications are reviewed by the specific Cornell college or school to which a student has applied.","Submit your Common Application online. … You're required to submit two teacher recommendations, which should highlight your academic strengths and contributions in the classroom. … As part of your Common Application, you'll be asked to fill out the Cornell University supplement, which includes the college- or school-specific essay(s) you'll need to answer. … You're required to submit SAT or ACT scores when applying to Cornell.","Personal interviews are not required, nor available, for admission to any of Cornell's other undergraduate level programs.","For applicants to Duffield Engineering, one of those recommendations must be from a math, science, or computer science teacher."]}
